Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Got You!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 43
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn’t have gone far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,These pieces of furniture…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,These pieces of furniture…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,can actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s back. What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we’ve been discovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,there’s no need to hide anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.59,0:01:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, they didn’t spot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.59,0:01:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But {\i1}I{\i0} spotted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.43,0:01:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You bumped into me, a noble sofa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.99,0:01:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And you nearly bumped into me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a big cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.75,0:01:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s try hiding in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.19,0:01:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s finally our turn to make an appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth are these creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nowhere left to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you people, and what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like {\i1}you{\i0} were the one who barged in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you let my friend go, we’ll leave right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s not up to us to decide. Our Young Miss gave orders
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,that no one is allowed to mess with things here, for any reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.47,0:02:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, she’s a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s not be too rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s wrap her up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.92,0:02:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and wait for Young Miss to return and decide how to handle her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll grab her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t go too far
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect her to have backup; let’s all attack together
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost didn’t make it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I’m okay now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s nothing wrong outside the window
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they so scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.07,0:03:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren’t afraid of anything; {\i1}you{\i0} should be the one who’s scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s catch her together
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven’t Tibbie and Jonie come out yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they really been caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There is absolutely no way the two of them can escape Pink’s manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, the manor you’re talking about—is it Pink’s?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn’t that person named Pink
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,off in another world, fighting Weslie and the others for the fragments?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If she isn’t there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,then what is there to be afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you’re underestimating her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop keeping us in suspense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell us who exactly is behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,When we first arrived here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,this world indicated the presence of only two fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,One was in the Silt Area, and the other was in the Xilan Tree’s Trial Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys already took the fragment from the Silt Area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To get the Xilan Tree fragment, a Flower Baby has to be brought to enter the Trial Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The one holding the fragment is likely her—who managed to enter the Trial Zone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.61,0:04:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mei Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.06,0:04:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it {\i1}is{\i0} someone from the Flower Tribe causing trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she isn’t necessarily from the Flower Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,When Lan Baobao and I were searching for the Spark,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.61,0:04:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,we encountered a mysterious person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.85,0:04:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She kept causing accidents to injure the Flower Babies who were searching for the Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There was only one goal:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To stop other Flower Babies from entering the Trial Grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, that mysterious person and Mei Huahua are companions?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,People in Flower Tribe don’t know about the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess this Mei Huahua is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.23,0:04:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,disguised by the mysterious person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like me pretending to be a member of the Flower Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.10,0:05:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie’s analysis is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Acting cool again
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn’t understand
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did she need to capture Lan Baobao after she got the fragment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I don’t know the specific reason, it should be related to the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That means, we can just grab this Mei Huahua
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and everything that happens in this world can be solved
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only this world
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the mastermind who attacked us in the first place can be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.57,0:05:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What you said makes sense
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s go find her and rescue Lan Baobao.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie can’t go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a fragment on your body; she will definitely come to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I will protect Planie and the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That Mei Huahua moves really fast
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,After her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting, stop fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you, Silt Tribe, who took action first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you who hurt our queen first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you we didn’t
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come again
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower Tribe Elder
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t fight anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you. Why did you let Silt Tribe attack our Flower Tribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a misunderstanding. Someone pretended to be a flower and hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why they—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else pretends to be a flower besides Weslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder, Mentor Mei Huahua has a question
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She took the multicolored fragment from the trial zone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and even trapped me. Fortunately, I was smart enough to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone should be careful about her
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.65,0:06:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mei Huahua
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought she would do such a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder, the Xilan Tree has a big hole
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.37,0:06:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The most important thing now is for us to work together to solve this problem
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder, let’s go see it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let’s go down below and see what’s going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the fragment
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.10,0:07:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the energy of our world and I will never give it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take the move
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.32,0:07:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you only have this little strength left, don’t do so many things anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.11,0:07:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not even going to pretend now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me to finish what you can’t do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With the power of my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That problem has been solved long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.91,0:08:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My fragment was taken away by her
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to catch me with just a piece of wool
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You underestimate the power of three fragments
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.99,0:08:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.84,0:08:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it’s like she has no physical body at all
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,what should we do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I won’t play with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,end it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to deal with her quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.99,0:09:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise Young Miss’s secret will be discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How on earth am I going to force the owner of this place to come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And my favorite Colorful Dandelions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,dandelion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.91,0:09:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,that’s it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.71,0:09:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear, help me get that bouquet of flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Her goal is Colorful Dandelions
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.23,0:09:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.39,0:09:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we have to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I guessed right; this flower is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what I’m capable of now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d better just surrender quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be the one saying that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.23,0:10:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give back the Colorful Dandelion right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re backing off—don’t do anything rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.27,0:10:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Make the owner of this place come out and see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the power of three fragments?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can’t waste any more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the fragments back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are such a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:11:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She has the fragments; we can’t let her get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The fragments are right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.98,0:11:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Silt photosphere shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s pinned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.17,0:11:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll let you off the hook this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That Mei Huahua is really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, she doesn’t want the fragment anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Fragments…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the earthquake is starting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like the Xilan Tree is failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it’s Lan Baobao.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flower Tribe has gone down to the Silt Area.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.05,0:11:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s hurry over and see if we can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.31,0:12:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly is getting in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, Miss Pink is angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re done for.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
